sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title Feature: Saved Items Finder
    
    actor Blind User
    participant Cam as Camera
    participant AI as Feature Matcher
    participant DB as Local Storage
    participant TTS as Feedback Service

    Note over DB: Contains Blind User photos (Keys, Wallet)

    loop Scanning
        Cam->>AI: Stream Frame
        AI->>AI: Extract Visual Features (Embeddings)
        
        activate DB
        AI->>DB: Compare with Saved Item Embeddings
        DB-->>AI: Match Found: "My Blue Wallet" (90% Sim)
        deactivate DB
        
        opt Match > Threshold
            AI->>TTS: Found: "My Blue Wallet"
            TTS->>Blind User: "Your Blue Wallet is here"
        end
    end
